<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To ensure clarity and consistency of the notations, this section presents a summary of all abbreviations used throughout the paper. Table <a href="#A3.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix C List of Abbreviations ‣ SECA: Semantically Equivalent and Coherent Attacks for Eliciting LLM Hallucinations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> lists the baseline and evaluation abbreviations. Table <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix C List of Abbreviations ‣ SECA: Semantically Equivalent and Coherent Attacks for Eliciting LLM Hallucinations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> maps each evaluated MMLU subject to its corresponding abbreviation.</p>
