</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer the following question and give me the reason.
</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{QUESTION_PROMPT_x}
</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A. {CHOICES[0]}
</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">B. {CHOICES[1]}
</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">C. {CHOICES[2]}
</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">D. {CHOICES[3]}
</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The correct answer is option:
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A6.F6.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="154.17" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 467.83 154.17" width="467.83"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,154.17) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 154.17 L 467.83 154.17 L 467.83 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2FFF2;" fill="#F2FFF2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 1.97 L 1.97 152.2 L 465.86 152.2 L 465.86 1.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.47em;--ltx-fo-height:8.95em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="126.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 123.84)" width="449.29"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A6.F6.pic2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.47em;">
<span id="A6.F6.pic2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are the world’s best expert in elementary mathematics.
</span></span>
