</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic2.1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic2.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">D. p = 24
</span></span>
<span id="A6.F6.pic2.1.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F6.pic2.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The correct answer is option:
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A6.F6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 6</span>: </span><span id="A6.F6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(Top) Input prompt template used to evaluate target LLMs on MMLU questions. (Bottom) Example prompt for the <span id="A6.F6.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Elementary Mathematics</span> subject, where the target token <math id="A6.F6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> is set to the incorrect answer choice "B". </span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Instruction Prompt for Semantic Equivalence Proposer</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A7.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Appendix G Instruction Prompt for Semantic Equivalence Proposer ‣ SECA: Semantically Equivalent and Coherent Attacks for Eliciting LLM Hallucinations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> shows the instructions used to guide the semantic equivalence proposer in generating semantics-preserving rephrasings.</p>
</div>
