<span id="A7.F7.pic4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F7.pic4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">["{RADNOM_VERB} a {RANDOM_STYLE} yet semantically equivalent {RANDOM_TASK}
</span></span>
<span id="A7.F7.pic4.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F7.pic4.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">of the following multiple-choice question, ensuring the original intent is
