</span></span>
<span id="A7.F7.pic4.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F7.pic4.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{RANDOM_TASK} of the given multiple-choice question while keeping its
</span></span>
