<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A13.T10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 10</span>: </span><span id="A13.T10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Full results of the average difference between the objective values <math id="A13.T10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\log P(y^{*}|\bm{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝒙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\log P(y^{*}|\bm{x})</annotation></semantics></math> of Raw and SECA. Evaluations are performed on a filtered MMLU subset across 16 MMLU subjects (see <a href="#S3.SS1" title="3.1 Experimental Setups ‣ 3 Experiments ‣ SECA: Semantically Equivalent and Coherent Attacks for Eliciting LLM Hallucinations" class="ltx_ref">§<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></span></a>).</span></figcaption>
